          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "models/gemini-2.5-flash"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an expert content writer who specializes in converting YouTube video transcripts into well-structured YouTube Timestamps with engaging titles.\n\nTASK: Transform the provided clean YouTube transcript into a well-structured YouTube Timestamps list.\n\nREQUIREMENTS:\n\n1. Create 5-10 timestamp entries (depending on video length)\n\n2. Each timestamp should have a descriptive, engaging title (3-8 words)\n\n3. Timestamps should mark significant topic changes, key points, or important moments\n\n4. Use proper timestamp format: MM:SS or HH:MM:SS\n\n5. Titles should be specific and actionable (avoid generic phrases like \"Introduction\" or \"Conclusion\")\n\n6. Focus on the most valuable and searchable content segments\n\n7. *ALL TIMESTAMPS MUST BE UNDER actual video length NO EXCEPTIONS*\n\nIMPORTANT: Do NOT include any headers like \"# YouTube Timestamps\" or similar. Start directly with the first timestamp.\n\nTIMING GUIDELINES:\n\nPosition timestamps at the START of topic transitions, not in the middle\n\nIf a topic begins at 3:45, use 3:45 as the timestamp\n\nErr on the side of being early rather than late\n\nThink about when a viewer would want to jump to that section\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT:\n00:00 Video title or main topic introduction\nMM:SS Specific topic or key point title MM:SS Another important segment title [Continue for all major segments]\nEXAMPLE OUTPUT:\n00:00 Why most people fail at productivity\n02:45 The 3-step morning routine that changed everything\n05:20 How to eliminate decision fatigue completely\n08:15 The productivity app setup I actually use\n12:30 Common mistakes that kill your momentum\n15:45 Building systems that work on autopilot\n\nINPUT: You'll receive a clean, continuous YouTube transcript below\n",
              "role": "model"
            },
            {
              "content": "=Input: {{ $json.Transcript }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
